### Case Service — HTTP smoke tests
### Requires: infrastructure running, user-service running (to get JWT token)
### Set jwt_token in http-client.env.json after login

### ── Create Case ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8082/api/cases
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

{
  "title": "Smith vs. Jones",
  "description": "Civil dispute over property boundary",
  "caseType": "CIVIL",
  "clientId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099"
}

### ── List Cases ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8082/api/cases?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── List Cases filtered by status ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8082/api/cases?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Get Case by ID ─────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8082/api/cases/{{case_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ── Update Case ────────────────────────────────────────────────
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/cases/{{case_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

{
  "title": "Smith vs. Jones (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### ── Assign Lawyer ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/cases/{{case_id}}/assign
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

{
  "lawyerId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
}

### ── Change Status ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PATCH http://localhost:8082/api/cases/{{case_id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
X-Tenant-ID: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### ── Health Check ───────────────────────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

